00:04:51.180 --> 00:04:59.810
 And urban gardening and the production of food has happened in different communities by different

00:04:59.810 --> 00:05:09.020
 populations, different groups of folks in the United States since, well, agriculture was

00:05:09.020 --> 00:05:11.980
 happening here pre-colonization, right, in many ways.

00:05:11.980 --> 00:05:18.390
 Post-colonization and in the industrial cities, urban agriculture has had a major presence in

00:05:18.390 --> 00:05:25.240
 the U.S. since the 1890s. And there's been at least seven major waves of urban gardening that have

00:05:25.240 --> 00:05:31.240
